WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.058
It was a hot day at the beach.

2
00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:13.917
"I need to cool off," said Bird.

3
00:00:13.918 --> 00:00:21.494
"Me too!" said Kip.

4
00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:25.141
Kip saw a big red box.

5
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:28.623
"I wonder what's in there," he said.

6
00:00:28.624 --> 00:00:35.724
"I'll look in and see," said Bird.

7
00:00:35.725 --> 00:00:39.134
Bird flew over the box.

8
00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:42.075
"Ice cubes!" she cried.

9
00:00:42.076 --> 00:00:45.513
"There are ice cubes in the box!"

10
00:00:45.514 --> 00:00:48.217
Bird flew into the box.

11
00:00:48.218 --> 00:00:57.663
Kip climbed up the side of the box.

12
00:00:57.664 --> 00:01:00.276
He jumped into the ice.

13
00:01:00.277 --> 00:01:03.937
Kip went under the ice.

14
00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:07.448
He popped back out.

15
00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:10.065
"Brr!" said Kip.

16
00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:12.289
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

17
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:16.961
"Ah, this ice feels great!" said Kip.

18
00:01:16.962 --> 00:01:18.992
"Yep," said Bird.

19
00:01:18.993 --> 00:01:22.349
"It doesn't get any better than this."

20
00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.714
"Hey!" yelled a man.

21
00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:28.718
"There's a bird and chipmunk in the cooler!"

22
00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:35.491
Bird and Kip escaped fast.

23
00:01:35.492 --> 00:01:38.678
"That was fun!" said Bird.

24
00:01:38.679 --> 00:01:43.592
"Yes," said Kip.

25
00:01:43.593 --> 00:01:50.727
"But I'm still hot!"

